<title>USA: Novoste names new chief operating officer.</title>
<headline>Novoste names new chief operating officer.</headline>
<dateline>NORCROSS, Ga. 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novoste Corp said Monday David N. Gill, chief financial officer, has been named to the added post of chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Novoste said Charles E. Larsen, who had been chief operating officer, has been named to the newly established office of chief technical officer.</p>
